<time datetime="2023-07-03">July 3, 2023</time>
<article id="WebbTelescope" class="WebBits EXPLORE">
    <h2>EXPLORE: Webb Space Telescope</h2>
    <p>
        The <strong>Space Telescope Science Institute</strong>,
        <abbr title="Space Telescope Science Institute">STScI</abbr>, hosts
        the James Webb Space telescope. Telescopes are cool! Check out Webb's
        beautiful website and the STScI beautiful website, each containing
        high-resolution graphics and modern web design styles.
    </p>
    <div>
        <h3 class="share-frame-link">
            <a href="https://webbtelescope.org/" rel="external noopener" target="_blank" title="Webb Home">Webb Home</a>
        </h3>
        <iframe class="frames" src="https://webbtelescope.org/" title="Webb Home" tabindex="-1"></iframe>
    </div>
    <aside class="examplePink explore">
        <h3>Example:</h3>
        <p>Deep exploration links:</p>
        <ul class="explore-links">
            <li>
                <a href="https://www.stsci.edu/events/webcasts" target="_blank" rel="external noopener" title="Webcasts">
                    STScI
                    Webcasts
                </a>
            </li>
            <li>
                <a href="https://webbtelescope.org/news/first-images/resources/microshutters#section-8a40bead-cb77-4bb2-b001-17fca64d6e1a"
                   target="_blank" rel="external noopener" title="Microshutters">Webb: Microshutters</a>
            </li>
            <li>
                <a href="https://webbtelescope.org/other-webb-sites" target="_blank" rel="external noopener"
                   title="Other Webb Sites">Other Webb Sites</a>
            </li>
        </ul>
    </aside>
    <div>
        <h3 class="share-frame-link">
            <a href="https://www.stsci.edu/" rel="external noopener" target="_blank" title="STScI Home">STScI Home</a>
        </h3>
        <iframe class="frames" src="https://www.stsci.edu/" title="STScI Home" tabindex="-1"></iframe>
    </div>
</article>
